}, Open  ]],

Cell["When \[Phi] = 0, \[Pi]/2, \[Pi], 3\[Pi]/2, the RGE in terms of h \
becomes,", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9570474112233915`*^9, 3.9570474673760395`*^9}, {
  3.9573014812862473`*^9, 3.957301494163263*^9}, {4.0011076014000916`*^9, 
