Cell["\<\
Both eigenvalues are negative. Hence, the fixed point is stable. By symmetry, \
one can argue that it is the same case for all \[Phi] = \[Pi]/4, 3\[Pi]/4, 5\
\[Pi]/4, 7\[Pi]/4,.\
\>", "Text",
